1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,522
Écoute ! J'entends quelqu'un pleurer !
Listen! I hear someone crying!

2
00:00:04,822 --> 00:00:08,950
C'est un petit chaton ! Il est perdu !
It's a little kitten! He's lost!

3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:13,162
Pauvre chaton ! Où est sa maison ?
Poor kitten! Where is his home?

4
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:18,142
Il a un collier. Regarde : « Rue des Fleurs ».
He has a collar. Look: "Flower Street".

5
00:00:18,442 --> 00:00:22,690
Pas de problème ! On y va ensemble !
No problem! Let's go together!

6
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,734
Voilà la maison ! Il est chez lui !
Here's the house! He's home!

7
00:00:27,034 --> 00:00:31,042
Le chaton sourit. Il est content !
The kitten is smiling. He's happy!

8
00:00:31,342 --> 00:00:34,342
Un bon héros trouve toujours le chemin !
A good hero always finds the way!

